  "readmeFile": "Async8.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Initial release of async8. This version includes foundational features such as Task extensions for error handling and timeouts, helpers for concurrent task execution, async caching mechanisms, and retry policies for transient fault handling. Future updates will focus on expanding features and improving performance.",
